      "statement": "worker.Pool.Notify writes to a capacity-1 buffered channel without blocking, so concurrent or repeated submissions coalesce into a single wakeup; ExecutionNotifier is declared in internal/handlers to avoid an import dependency on internal/worker, and worker.Pool is its concrete implementation wired in cmd/server/main.go.",
