      "statement": "worker.ExecutorRunner.Run resolves the action, decodes stored params into map[string]string, applies a per-execution timeout (ROSA_TA_WORKER_EXECUTION_TIMEOUT, default 2 minutes) via context.WithTimeout, and calls executor.Executor.Execute with Target left nil so the owning Scope derives it from Params.",
      "evidence": [
